 # 14\. Prompt Engineering Plan

 ComicCraft should maintain reusable prompt templates instead of putting prompts directly inside UI components.

 Example:

```
prompts/
├── story.ts
├── characters.ts
├── panels.ts
├── dialogue.ts
├── regenerate.ts
└── continuation.ts
```

 Every prompt should specify:

 - User idea
- Genre
- Tone
- Style
- Story Bible
- Existing characters
- Existing story context
- Required output structure

 This makes AI behavior easier to maintain and improve.

