 # 20\. Risk Management

 | Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Gemini API failure | High | Retry/error handling |
| Invalid AI output | High | Structured output + Zod |
| AI costs increase | High | Usage limits and controlled generation |
| Slow generation | Medium | Progress UI and optimized requests |
| Story inconsistency | Medium | Story Bible |
| Database failure | High | Backups and error handling |
| Scope expansion | High | Strict MVP boundaries |
| Security issue | High | Server-side keys and authorization |
| Export bugs | Medium | Dedicated export testing |

