 # 21\. Scope Control

 A major planning principle is:

 > **Build the smallest complete comic workflow first.**

 Avoid adding too many features during MVP development.

 ### MVP

```
Idea
 ↓
Gemini
 ↓
Story
 ↓
Panels
 ↓
Edit
 ↓
Preview
 ↓
Export
```

