 # 25\. Project Success Criteria

 ComicCraft should be considered successful when a user can independently complete the following:

 > **Sign in → create a comic → enter an idea → generate a story with Gemini → receive characters and panels → edit the content → regenerate a panel → save the project → preview the comic → export it.**

 The system should perform this workflow reliably without requiring the user to understand how Gemini or the underlying technology works.

